  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Owned by a long time WaterColor owner and nestled on a quiet and serene cul-de-sac with stunning views of one of WaterColor's beautifully landscaped parks, our vacation home is just a quick bike ride from the beach, boutique shops, and grocery stores. Enjoy your own private oasis with a newly added pool, spa, and summer kitchen—perfect for relaxation and fun for all ages! With a brand-new golf cart EZ-GO Lithium Golf Cart (October 2024), you can scoot around to anywhere on 30A quickly! <br><br>Accommodating up to 14 guests and access to all of WaterColor's amazing amenities, our home features access to 5 spacious bedrooms, each with its own ensuite bathroom, plus a bonus bunk room. Ideal for family gatherings, it also includes an attached carriage house with a kitchenette.<br><br>For a virtual tour, please click https://youtu.be/TD4mN11bP44 . <br><br>The bright, open-concept layout boasts a cozy living room with ample seating, a 65\" Samsung TV, and a Sonos surround sound system—perfect for unwinding after a day at the beach or entertaining friends. The chef's kitchen is equipped with professional-grade appliances and all the essentials for crafting gourmet meals. Host memorable dinners at the elegant formal dining table, illuminated by a stunning artisan chandelier, with additional seating at the breakfast bar for six. All bedrooms come equipped with noise machines and charging ports for ultimate ease! <br><br><br>Step outside to embrace outdoor living at its best! Enjoy al fresco dining, a built-in gas grill, and the refreshing private pool and spa, all with picturesque views of the Point Washington State Preserve. Picture yourself sipping cocktails while the kids play or enjoying a peaceful morning coffee. The private pool and spa can be heated for an additional fee during cooler months.<br><br>Make your vacation unforgettable in our exquisite home!<br><br>- Per WaterColor HOA, all guests 5 years of age or older must be included in your adult guest total in order to receive wristbands to access amenities and pools. This home is allotted 14 wristbands.<br>- Newly renovated!<br>- Located in Watercolor's Park District<br>- Fully-equipped gourmet kitchen features white quartz countertops, farmhouse sink, NEW All-Clad Cookware and gas range<br>- Full-size high-efficiency washer and dryer<br>- Incredible WI-FI<br>- Open-air front porch <br>- Propane gas grill<br>- Dedicated parking for 3 vehicles<br>- Four adult bikes<br>-Additional Guest Fee Covers Access to All Amenity Access for all Pools, Beach Club, and Events",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Stunningly Renovated Home in WaterColor with Pool/Access to All WC Amenities!"
        }
      ],
